0-9e5c9f0aa1dc.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/43015d8a-b04e-4cdb-b1d9-858f979df89a.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p></p>","subject":"Computer Science Engineer"},{"qnum":59,"type":"MCQ","correct":"A","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/09a7272b-9406-4313-9d88-97915feb29c5.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<p>a</p>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<p>b</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<p>c</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<p>d</p>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><img src=\"/media/b2054d036a9f03841ec2e54ae7d76016053c7a38.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Computer Science Engineer"},{"qnum":60,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/97f986c4-d445-4644-b8a5-b8b61306705e.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<p>a</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<p>b</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<p>c</p>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<p>d</p>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/30f11b33-a3a2-4aec-80fc-a31ace50e92e.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/fc210779-fd0e-4380-9721-771a9d999075.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Computer Science Engineer"},{"qnum":61,"type":"MCQ","correct":"B","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/3daee3a0-6079-4247-944e-c2ee0a6f87a6.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<p>a</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<p>b</p>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"<p>c</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<p>d</p>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/da8670ce-9f98-4496-a952-07621a88ccbd.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><span>Now check whether A &rarr; &epsilon; also goes into M[A, e]. That happens only if <strong>e &isin; FOLLOW(A)</strong>.</span></p>\n<p><span>Compute FOLLOW(A) quickly:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span>From <strong>S &rarr; b S d A</strong>, A is at the end &rArr; FOLLOW(A) &supe; FOLLOW(S)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span>FOLLOW(S) contains <strong>$</strong> (start symbol) and also from <strong>A &rarr; e S c</strong>, S is followed by <code>c</code> &rArr; <code>c &isin; FOLLOW(S)</code>, and from <strong>S &rarr; b S d A</strong>, S is followed by <code>d</code> &rArr; <code>d &isin; FOLLOW(S)</code></span><br /><span> So FOLLOW(S) = { $, c, d }</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span>From <strong>B &rarr; bA</strong>, A is at end &rArr; FOLLOW(A) &supe; FOLLOW(B)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span>From <strong>S &rarr; a B c d</strong>, B is followed by <code>c</code> &rArr; <code>c &isin; FOLLOW(B)</code>; from <strong>B &rarr; b B a</strong>, B is followed by <code>a</code> &rArr; <code>a &isin; FOLLOW(B)</code></span><br /><span> So FOLLOW(B) includes { c, a }</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><span>Hence:</span><br /><span> FOLLOW(A) includes { $, c, d, a }</span><br /><span> So <strong>e &notin; FOLLOW(A)</strong>, therefore <strong>A &rarr; &epsilon; is NOT placed in M[A, e]</strong>.</span></p>","subject":"Computer Science Engineer"},{"qnum":62,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/2893efdd-10c7-4231-a487-5ee22e180069.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<p>a</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<p>b</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<p>c</p>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<p>d</p>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":